# Build artifacts
*.o
*.dump
*.sym
*.log

# Compiled test binaries.  Every test's Makefile builds TARGET = smc_<name>_test
# (underscored -- see e.g. smc-beu-test/Makefile -- specifically so it never
# collides with the hyphenated smc-<name>-test/ source directory of the same
# test).  This one glob covers every test's binary; do NOT add per-test
# hyphenated entries here (smc-<name>-test would match the source directory
# itself, not its binary, and has silently hidden whole test directories from
# `git status`/`git add` in the past).
smc_*_test
